{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23930","headline":"酬别微之 · 白居易","name":"酬别微之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"[沣]头峡口钱唐岸，三别都经二十年。\n且喜筋骸俱健在，勿嫌须鬓各皤然。\n君归北阙朝天帝，我住东京作地仙。\n博望自来非弃置，承明重入莫拘牵。\n醉收桮杓停灯语，寒展衾裯对枕眠。\n犹被分司官系绊，送君不得过甘泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23930.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23930","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}